<metadata><name>WFG-1A2B3C4D-000002</name><desc>movement_mode=WALK (owner_selected_on_device). start_reason=AUTO_RESUMED_AFTER_RESET resumed_from=WFG-1A2B3C4D-000001. Coordinates as received from GNSS, not map-matched. HDOP is a unitless dilution factor, not metres. Track segments break at every NOFIX row. STATUS rows (battery, storage) are in the CSV only.</desc></metadata>
